<title>NEW ZEALAND: National's Ian Revell elected as deputy NZ speaker.</title>
<headline>National's Ian Revell elected as deputy NZ speaker.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parliament on Friday elected National's Member of Parliament for Northcote, Ian Revell, as deputy to the speaker, Doug Kidd.</p>
<p>Labour had sought support to have senior MP Jonathan Hunt installed as deputy and vigorously opposed Revell's selection.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
